WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
Often when you're visiting somewhere, you'll need to take photos.

2
00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:06.120
You can send them straight to Quickler on WhatsApp.

3
00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:08.610
There's no need to say what the photos are for.

4
00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:11.760
Quickler works it out and puts each photo where it belongs.

5
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:15.600
If one does land in the wrong place, just drag it to the right one.

6
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.800
That change is logged and used to improve Quickler for you next time.
